---
import BaseLayout from '../components/BaseLayout.astro';
import Circle from '../components/Circle.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="ABOUT"
  description="What Original is, who maintains it, and how its files are kept."
>
  <header class="page-head">
    <h1 class="page-title"><Circle /> ABOUT</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      A cornerstone for files, references, and tools — kept by Verlintas.
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>THE SITE</h2>
      <p>
        Original is the foundation I build from: a stable address on the web for reference files I
        reuse, licenses and policies I rely on, and small tools I want available from any device.
        It also reports the state of my projects and of the services they run on.
      </p>
      <p>
        There are no accounts, no comments, and no tracking scripts. The site is generated as
        static files and served from GitHub Pages.
      </p>

      <h2>WHAT IS HERE</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>STATUS</strong> — live checks of this site, my other sites, my GitHub projects, and GitHub itself.</li>
        <li><strong>FILES</strong> — licenses, copyright headers, and policy/governance templates, kept as canonical plain text.</li>
        <li><strong>UNIVERSE</strong> — browser tools, each on its own page: SHA-256 checksums, JSON formatting, and license comparison.</li>
        <li><strong>CLI</strong> — a terminal interface to the same content, reachable from the footer or at <code>/cli/</code>.</li>
        <li><strong>Machine index</strong> — <a href="/index.json">/index.json</a> and <a href="/llms.txt">/llms.txt</a> describe the site for scripts and AI agents.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>WHO RUNS IT</h2>
      <p>
        The site is maintained by <strong>Verlintas</strong>, a developer working mostly on
        Android and local-first software. Recent public projects include{' '}
        <a href="https://github.com/Verlintas/NovaBAIC">NovaBAIC</a>,{' '}
        <a href="https://github.com/Verlintas/OpenVisum">OpenVisum</a>, and{' '}
        <a href="https://github.com/Verlintas/OpenTraduko">OpenTraduko</a>{' '}
        — the <a href="/status/">STATUS</a> page lists them with their latest activity.
      </p>

      <h2>HOW FILES ARE KEPT</h2>
      <p>
        Every file carries a date, version, format, size and — where possible — a SHA-256
        checksum. Canonical third-party texts name their source. Templates written here are
        released under CC0-1.0 unless the file itself says otherwise. Files are versioned in git;
        replacing a file means adding a new version, not overwriting history.
      </p>

      <h2>QUESTIONS</h2>
      <h3>Why is there no account system?</h3>
      <p>Nothing on the site needs one. Files are public and tools run locally in the browser.</p>
      <h3>Can I reuse the templates?</h3>
      <p>
        Yes. Headers and templates marked CC0-1.0 are free to copy and adapt. The privacy
        templates are starting points, not legal advice — have them reviewed before use.
      </p>
      <h3>How do I report a problem?</h3>
      <p>
        Open an issue on <a href="https://github.com/Verlintas/original">the repository</a> or
        write to <a href="mailto:contact@original.wales">contact@original.wales</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>CONTACT</h2>
      <p>
        <a href="mailto:contact@original.wales">contact@original.wales</a><br />
        <a href="mailto:security@original.wales">security@original.wales</a> — vulnerabilities<br />
        <a href="https://github.com/Verlintas">GitHub — Verlintas</a>
      </p>
    </div>

    <aside class="about-aside" aria-label="Site facts">
      <h2>Facts</h2>
      <ul class="facts">
        <li><span class="fact-key">Domain</span><span>original.wales</span></li>
        <li><span class="fact-key">Contact</span><span><a href="mailto:contact@original.wales">contact@original.wales</a></span></li>
        <li><span class="fact-key">Launched</span><span>2026</span></li>
        <li><span class="fact-key">Generator</span><span>Astro</span></li>
        <li><span class="fact-key">Hosting</span><span>GitHub Pages</span></li>
        <li><span class="fact-key">Source</span><span><a href="https://github.com/Verlintas/original">Verlintas/original</a></span></li>
        <li><span class="fact-key">CLI</span><span><a href="/cli/">/cli/</a></span></li>
        <li><span class="fact-key">Feed</span><span><a href="/rss.xml">/rss.xml</a></span></li>
      </ul>
    </aside>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
